  "description": "Four guardian gods, one heart to win! \n\nBlessed with looks and talent, Su-Ji craves a quiet life—but four stunning boys, revealed as guardian gods of the cardinal directions, are determined to win her heart. With divine suitors on her tail, can Su-Ji stay under the radar while juggling their heavenly affections? \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
